%% Sequence — the evaluation gate (offline, in CI). Blocks merge/deploy on regression.
%% Render with mermaid.live or: mmdc -i sequence-eval-gate.mmd -o sequence-eval-gate.svg
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Engineer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions (pr-checks)
    participant Runner as EvaluationGate.run (evals/run.py)
    participant Gold as load_golden(*.jsonl)
    participant Pipe as Pipeline runtime
    participant Metrics as Metrics (Ragas / DeepEval / tool_selection / judge)
    participant Judge as Judge model (alias=judge)
    participant Thr as Thresholds (evaluators.yaml)

    Dev->>GH: open PR (prompts/agents/models/evals changed)
    GH->>GH: azure/login (OIDC, no stored keys)
    GH->>GH: lint + unit + contract tests
    GH->>Runner: python evals/run.py --subset changed --fail-under baseline
    Runner->>Gold: load golden cases for changed use case
    loop each golden case
        Runner->>Pipe: run(case.input)
        Pipe-->>Runner: output + trace
        Runner->>Metrics: score(case, output, trace)
        opt LLM-as-judge / Ragas LLM metrics
            Metrics->>Judge: grade against rubric / reference
            Judge-->>Metrics: score
        end
        Metrics-->>Runner: MetricScore per metric
    end
    Runner->>Thr: check(aggregated scores)
    Note over Thr: baseline-relative delta + absolute floors<br/>(PII=0, unsafe=0, groundedness>=0.9)
    Thr-->>Runner: GateDecision(pass|fail, per-metric)
    alt any metric below floor or baseline
        Runner-->>GH: exit non-zero (EvaluationGateFailed)
        GH-->>Dev: PR blocked with failing metrics report
    else all pass
        Runner-->>GH: exit 0 + GateReport
        GH-->>Dev: check green, merge allowed
    end
